18
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:51,100
pero claramente peor.

19
00:00:51,650 --> 00:00:53,300
Comenta la palabra…

20
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:56,600
SEÑUELO

21
00:00:56,650 --> 00:00:58,800
Te mando ejemplos

22
